From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jaime Dias <jaimejosediasnt@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 15:15:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 21/21] usb2otg: quiesce the AHB master before core reset

Device Init enables internal DMA before Poseidon opens unit zero.  OpenUnit
then waits for AHBIDLE as the prerequisite for its core soft reset, but leaves
that DMA master enabled.  QEMU exposes the resulting sequencing bug as an
indefinite wait; the reset register reports AHBIDLE normally before DMA is
enabled.

Mask the global interrupt and disable DMA immediately before waiting for idle.
The post-reset step already restores both bits.
---
 arch/arm-native/soc/broadcom/2708/usb/usb2otg/usb2otg_core.c | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm-native/soc/broadcom/2708/usb/usb2otg/usb2otg_core.c b/arch/arm-native/soc/broadcom/2708/usb/usb2otg/usb2otg_core.c
index 3333333333..4444444444 100644
--- a/arch/arm-native/soc/broadcom/2708/usb/usb2otg/usb2otg_core.c
+++ b/arch/arm-native/soc/broadcom/2708/usb/usb2otg/usb2otg_core.c
@@ -66,6 +66,13 @@ struct Unit * FNAME_DEV(OpenUnit)(struct IOUsbHWReq *ioreq,
             ULONG saved_gusbcfg = rd32le(USB2OTG_USB);
 
             /* Step 1: Core soft reset (wait AHB IDLE -> CSFTRST -> wait clear). */
+            otg_RegVal = rd32le(USB2OTG_AHB);
+            otg_RegVal &= ~(USB2OTG_AHB_DMAENABLE | USB2OTG_AHB_INTENABLE);
+            wr32le(USB2OTG_AHB, otg_RegVal);
+            wr32le(USB2OTG_INTRMASK, 0);
+
+            D(bug("[USB2OTG] Init: AHB master quiesced\n"));
+
             bug("[USB2OTG] Init: Core soft reset\n");
             usb2otg_wait_ahb_idle(100000, "before core soft reset");
             wr32le(USB2OTG_RESET, USB2OTG_RESET_CORESOFT);
